{
  "$schemaVersion": 1,
  "case": "compression-raw",
  "description": "Wire-level compression probe (Stage 7e slice 0). Uses raw-socket mode so the on-the-wire `Content-Encoding` is observable (Node's fetch transparently decompresses). Pins the reference's `compression@1.8.1` middleware surface: the default threshold (1024 B), the negotiation preference `br > gzip > deflate`, the `Vary: Accept-Encoding` invariant (always set when the middleware runs, even when compression is skipped), the MIME-based skip for non-compressible types, the HEAD / no-transform / Range skip conditions, and the Stage 7d OPTIONS-as-GET composition. Backs SRV-CLI-012 and closes Q-002. Snapshots here are reference-only until Stage 7e slice 2 lands the irserve implementation.",
  "fixture": {
    "files": {
      "tiny.html": "<!doctype html><title>tiny</title><p>short</p>\n",
      "big.html": "<!doctype html><html><head><title>big</title></head><body>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n<p>one fish two fish red fish blue fish — repeated to defeat the 1024-byte compression threshold so the reference's middleware engages.</p>\n</body></html>\n",
      "big.css": "/* > 1024-byte css to defeat the compression threshold */\n.alpha { color: red; background: white; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.beta  { color: blue; background: yellow; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.gamma { color: green; background: cyan; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.delta { color: orange; background: magenta; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.alpha2 { color: red; background: white; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.beta2  { color: blue; background: yellow; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.gamma2 { color: green; background: cyan; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.delta2 { color: orange; background: magenta; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.alpha3 { color: red; background: white; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.beta3  { color: blue; background: yellow; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.gamma3 { color: green; background: cyan; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.delta3 { color: orange; background: magenta; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.alpha4 { color: red; background: white; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.beta4  { color: blue; background: yellow; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n.gamma4 { color: green; background: cyan; border: 1px solid black; padding: 8px; margin: 0; }\n",
      "big.js": "// > 1024-byte js fixture to defeat the compression threshold\nfunction greet(name) { return 'hello, ' + name + '! welcome to compression land.'; }\nfunction farewell(name) { return 'goodbye, ' + name + '. enjoy your gzip-shaped present.'; }\nfunction repeat(s, n) { let out = ''; for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) out += s; return out; }\nfunction shout(s) { return s.toUpperCase() + '!'; }\nfunction whisper(s) { return s.toLowerCase() + '...'; }\nfunction count(arr) { return arr.length; }\nfunction sum(arr) { return arr.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0); }\nfunction avg(arr) { return arr.length === 0 ? 0 : sum(arr) / arr.length; }\nfunction min(arr) { return arr.reduce((a, b) => a < b ? a : b, Infinity); }\nfunction max(arr) { return arr.reduce((a, b) => a > b ? a : b, -Infinity); }\nfunction zip(a, b) { return a.map((x, i) => [x, b[i]]); }\nfunction range(n) { return Array.from({length: n}, (_, i) => i); }\nfunction uppercase(s) { return s.toUpperCase(); }\nfunction lowercase(s) { return s.toLowerCase(); }\nfunction firstChar(s) { return s.charAt(0); }\nfunction lastChar(s) { return s.charAt(s.length - 1); }\nexport { greet, farewell, repeat, shout, whisper, count, sum, avg, min, max, zip, range, uppercase, lowercase, firstChar, lastChar };\n",
      "data.json": "{ \"description\": \"> 1024-byte json fixture for compression-threshold probing\", \"items\": [ { \"id\": 1, \"name\": \"alpha\", \"detail\": \"first quadrant, color red, padding default, border solid black\" }, { \"id\": 2, \"name\": \"beta\", \"detail\": \"second quadrant, color blue, padding default, border solid black\" }, { \"id\": 3, \"name\": \"gamma\", \"detail\": \"third quadrant, color green, padding default, border solid black\" }, { \"id\": 4, \"name\": \"delta\", \"detail\": \"fourth quadrant, color orange, padding default, border solid black\" }, { \"id\": 5, \"name\": \"epsilon\", \"detail\": \"fifth quadrant, color magenta, padding default, border solid black\" }, { \"id\": 6, \"name\": \"zeta\", \"detail\": \"sixth quadrant, color cyan, padding default, border solid black\" }, { \"id\": 7, \"name\": \"eta\", \"detail\": \"seventh quadrant, color yellow, padding default, border solid black\" }, { \"id\": 8, \"name\": \"theta\", \"detail\": \"eighth quadrant, color teal, padding default, border solid black\" }, { \"id\": 9, \"name\": \"iota\", \"detail\": \"ninth quadrant, color brown, padding default, border solid black\" } ] }\n",
      "vector.svg": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<!-- > 1024-byte svg fixture for compression-threshold probing -->\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\">\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"red\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <rect x=\"60\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <rect x=\"110\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"green\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"60\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"orange\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <rect x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"magenta\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <rect x=\"110\" y=\"60\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"cyan\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"110\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"yellow\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <rect x=\"60\" y=\"110\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"purple\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <rect x=\"110\" y=\"110\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" fill=\"pink\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n</svg>\n",
      "big-no-transform.html": "<!doctype html><html><head><title>no-transform</title></head><body>\n<p>this body is above the compression threshold but the user `headers` rule sets `Cache-Control: no-transform` so the middleware MUST skip compression per RFC 7234 §5.2.2.4 and `compression/index.js:293-300`.</p>\n<p>this body is above the compression threshold but the user `headers` rule sets `Cache-Control: no-transform` so the middleware MUST skip compression per RFC 7234 §5.2.2.4 and `compression/index.js:293-300`.</p>\n<p>this body is above the compression threshold but the user `headers` rule sets `Cache-Control: no-transform` so the middleware MUST skip compression per RFC 7234 §5.2.2.4 and `compression/index.js:293-300`.</p>\n<p>this body is above the compression threshold but the user `headers` rule sets `Cache-Control: no-transform` so the middleware MUST skip compression per RFC 7234 §5.2.2.4 and `compression/index.js:293-300`.</p>\n<p>this body is above the compression threshold but the user `headers` rule sets `Cache-Control: no-transform` so the middleware MUST skip compression per RFC 7234 §5.2.2.4 and `compression/index.js:293-300`.</p>\n</body></html>\n",
